# UML State Diagrams

## 1. Student Document Request State Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NotRequested

    NotRequested --> RequestFormOpened: Student opens Documents page
    RequestFormOpened --> DocumentTypeSelected: Select document type
    DocumentTypeSelected --> Submitted: Submit request

    Submitted --> PendingReview: System stores request
    PendingReview --> UnderReview: Teacher views request

    UnderReview --> Approved: Teacher approves request
    UnderReview --> Rejected: Teacher rejects request

    Approved --> DocumentGenerated: System generates PDF
    DocumentGenerated --> ReadyForDownload: Download button appears
    ReadyForDownload --> Downloaded: Student downloads document
    Downloaded --> [*]

    Rejected --> StudentNotified: System sends rejection notification
    StudentNotified --> [*]
```

## 2. User Account / Login Session State Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unregistered

    Unregistered --> Registering: User enters name, email, password, role
    Registering --> RegistrationRejected: Invalid or missing information
    RegistrationRejected --> Registering: Correct information

    Registering --> AccountCreated: Valid information submitted
    AccountCreated --> LoggedOut

    LoggedOut --> LoggingIn: User enters username/email and password
    LoggingIn --> LoginFailed: Invalid credentials
    LoginFailed --> LoggingIn: Try again

    LoggingIn --> Authenticated: Credentials verified
    Authenticated --> RoleChecked: System checks role

    RoleChecked --> StudentDashboard: Role = Student
    RoleChecked --> TeacherDashboard: Role = Teacher
    RoleChecked --> ITStaffDashboard: Role = IT Staff

    StudentDashboard --> LoggedOut: Logout
    TeacherDashboard --> LoggedOut: Logout
    ITStaffDashboard --> LoggedOut: Logout

    ITStaffDashboard --> AccountUpdated: Create / update / deactivate account
    AccountUpdated --> ITStaffDashboard

    LoggedOut --> [*]
```
